{
  "_comment": "Animation scenes are DATA, never hardcoded choreography — a new one is written here without touching either renderer. Read by BOTH: the JS core imports this file at build time, the Python renderer reads it at run time. Format: SCENES.md.",

  "scenes": [
    {
      "name": "turntable",
      "label": "Turntable",
      "duration": 8,
      "loop": true,
      "tracks": [
        {
          "channel": "camera.azimuth",
          "keys": [{ "t": 0, "value": 45 }, { "t": 1, "value": 405 }]
        },
        {
          "channel": "camera.elevation",
          "keys": [{ "t": 0, "value": 25 }]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "tour",
      "label": "View tour",
      "duration": 12,
      "loop": true,
      "tracks": [
        {
          "channel": "camera.azimuth",
          "keys": [
            { "t": 0.00, "value": 0,   "ease": "ease-in-out" },
            { "t": 0.15, "value": 0,   "ease": "ease-in-out" },
            { "t": 0.33, "value": 90,  "ease": "ease-in-out" },
            { "t": 0.50, "value": 180, "ease": "ease-in-out" },
            { "t": 0.67, "value": 270, "ease": "ease-in-out" },
            { "t": 0.84, "value": 270, "ease": "ease-in-out" },
            { "t": 1.00, "value": 405 }
          ]
        },
        {
          "channel": "camera.elevation",
          "keys": [
            { "t": 0.00, "value": 0,      "ease": "ease-in-out" },
            { "t": 0.67, "value": 0,      "ease": "ease-in-out" },
            { "t": 0.84, "value": 88,     "ease": "ease-in-out" },
            { "t": 1.00, "value": 35.264 }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "_comment": "The theory answer, animated: a cube seen down its body diagonal is a regular hexagon ONLY under orthographic projection, so the flight lands on azimuth 45 / elevation asin(1/sqrt3) and switches projection there.",
      "name": "hexagon",
      "label": "Hexagon reveal",
      "duration": 6,
      "loop": false,
      "content": { "type": "cube", "colors": "poles" },
      "tracks": [
        {
          "channel": "camera.azimuth",
          "keys": [
            { "t": 0, "value": 0, "ease": "ease-in-out" },
            { "t": 0.75, "value": 45 }
          ]
        },
        {
          "channel": "camera.elevation",
          "keys": [
            { "t": 0, "value": 0, "ease": "ease-in-out" },
            { "t": 0.75, "value": 35.264 }
          ]
        },
        {
          "channel": "camera.projection",
          "keys": [
            { "t": 0, "value": "perspective" },
            { "t": 0.75, "value": "orthographic" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "channel": "camera.dolly",
          "keys": [
            { "t": 0, "value": 1, "ease": "ease-in-out" },
            { "t": 0.75, "value": 1, "ease": "ease-in-out" },
            { "t": 1, "value": 1.2 }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "_comment": "Per-part opacity as a tweened parameter: the shell turns to glass and the core inside becomes visible, then comes back.",
      "name": "xray",
      "label": "X-ray shell",
      "duration": 7,
      "loop": true,
      "content": {
        "type": "cube",
        "name": "shell",
        "colors": "poles",
        "children": [{ "type": "cube", "name": "core", "size": 0.45, "color": "#F5F5F5" }]
      },
      "tracks": [
        {
          "channel": "camera.azimuth",
          "keys": [{ "t": 0, "value": 45 }, { "t": 1, "value": 405 }]
        },
        {
          "channel": "camera.elevation",
          "keys": [{ "t": 0, "value": 22 }]
        },
        {
          "channel": "part.opacity", "path": "shell/face:+x",
          "keys": [
            { "t": 0, "value": 1, "ease": "ease-in-out" },
            { "t": 0.3, "value": 0.12 },
            { "t": 0.7, "value": 0.12, "ease": "ease-in-out" },
            { "t": 1, "value": 1 }
          ]
        },
        {
          "channel": "part.opacity", "path": "shell/face:-x",
          "keys": [
            { "t": 0, "value": 1, "ease": "ease-in-out" },
            { "t": 0.3, "value": 0.12 },
            { "t": 0.7, "value": 0.12, "ease": "ease-in-out" },
            { "t": 1, "value": 1 }
          ]
        },
        {
          "channel": "part.opacity", "path": "shell/face:+y",
          "keys": [
            { "t": 0, "value": 1, "ease": "ease-in-out" },
            { "t": 0.3, "value": 0.12 },
            { "t": 0.7, "value": 0.12, "ease": "ease-in-out" },
            { "t": 1, "value": 1 }
          ]
        },
        {
          "channel": "part.opacity", "path": "shell/face:-y",
          "keys": [
            { "t": 0, "value": 1, "ease": "ease-in-out" },
            { "t": 0.3, "value": 0.12 },
            { "t": 0.7, "value": 0.12, "ease": "ease-in-out" },
            { "t": 1, "value": 1 }
          ]
        },
        {
          "channel": "part.opacity", "path": "shell/face:+z",
          "keys": [
            { "t": 0, "value": 1, "ease": "ease-in-out" },
            { "t": 0.3, "value": 0.12 },
            { "t": 0.7, "value": 0.12, "ease": "ease-in-out" },
            { "t": 1, "value": 1 }
          ]
        },
        {
          "channel": "part.opacity", "path": "shell/face:-z",
          "keys": [
            { "t": 0, "value": 1, "ease": "ease-in-out" },
            { "t": 0.3, "value": 0.12 },
            { "t": 0.7, "value": 0.12, "ease": "ease-in-out" },
            { "t": 1, "value": 1 }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "_comment": "The owner's case from MODELS.md — three legend terms per axis tip, showing one at a time — driven by the timeline instead of by hand. Non-numeric values are stepped, so `group.show` needs no easing.",
      "name": "legend",
      "label": "Legend cycle",
      "duration": 9,
      "loop": true,
      "content": {
        "type": "axes",
        "arms": [
          { "axis": "+x", "label": ["East", "Istok", "E"] },
          { "axis": "-x", "label": ["West", "Zapad", "W"] },
          { "axis": "+y", "label": ["Zenith", "Zenit", "Up"] },
          { "axis": "-y", "label": ["Nadir", "Nadir", "Down"] },
          { "axis": "+z", "label": ["North", "Sever", "N"] },
          { "axis": "-z", "label": ["South", "Jug", "S"] }
        ]
      },
      "tracks": [
        {
          "channel": "camera.azimuth",
          "keys": [{ "t": 0, "value": 25 }, { "t": 1, "value": 385 }]
        },
        {
          "channel": "camera.elevation",
          "keys": [{ "t": 0, "value": 18 }]
        },
        {
          "channel": "group.show", "path": "axes/arm:+x/labels",
          "keys": [
            { "t": 0, "value": "label:0" },
            { "t": 0.34, "value": "label:1" },
            { "t": 0.67, "value": "label:2" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "channel": "group.show", "path": "axes/arm:-x/labels",
          "keys": [
            { "t": 0, "value": "label:0" },
            { "t": 0.34, "value": "label:1" },
            { "t": 0.67, "value": "label:2" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "channel": "group.show", "path": "axes/arm:+y/labels",
          "keys": [
            { "t": 0, "value": "label:0" },
            { "t": 0.34, "value": "label:1" },
            { "t": 0.67, "value": "label:2" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "channel": "group.show", "path": "axes/arm:-y/labels",
          "keys": [
            { "t": 0, "value": "label:0" },
            { "t": 0.34, "value": "label:1" },
            { "t": 0.67, "value": "label:2" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "channel": "group.show", "path": "axes/arm:+z/labels",
          "keys": [
            { "t": 0, "value": "label:0" },
            { "t": 0.34, "value": "label:1" },
            { "t": 0.67, "value": "label:2" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "channel": "group.show", "path": "axes/arm:-z/labels",
          "keys": [
            { "t": 0, "value": "label:0" },
            { "t": 0.34, "value": "label:1" },
            { "t": 0.67, "value": "label:2" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
